===Noun===
'''negation''' (''[[countable]] and [[uncountable]]; plural'' '''negations''')
{{wikipedia}}
#(''uncountable'') the act of [[negating]] something
#(''countable'') a [[denial]] or [[contradiction]]
#{{logic}} (''countable'') a [[proposition]] that is [[true]] if and only if another one is [[false]]; a proposition resulting from the application to another proposition of the [[logical]] [[operation]] "[[not]]"

